#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House1/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House1_Text_IllTradeIfYouWant"
msgid ""
"Huh? My POKéMON is cute?\n"
"Sure, I knew that.\p"
"But if you really want, I'm willing\n"
"to trade it to you.\p"
"I'll trade you my {STR_VAR_2} for\n"
"a {STR_VAR_1} if you want.$"
msgstr ""
"咦？我的宝可梦很可爱？\n"
"那当然，我早就知道了。\p"
"不过如果你真的想要，\n"
"我也可以跟你交换。\p"
"你想要的话，我可以用我的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}换你的{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House1/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House1_Text_PleaseBeGoodToMyPokemon"
msgid ""
"Eheheh…\n"
"Please be good to my POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿嘿……\n"
"请好好对待我的宝可梦哦。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House1/scripts.inc:45
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House1_Text_DoesntLookLikeMonToMe"
msgid ""
"Huh? That doesn't look anything like\n"
"a {STR_VAR_1} to me.$"
msgstr ""
"咦？这在我看来\n"
"一点都不像{STR_VAR_1}啊。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House1/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House1_Text_YouDontWantToThatsOkay"
msgid ""
"Oh, if you don't want to, that's okay.\n"
"But my POKéMON is cute, you know…$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你不想换的话也没关系。\n"
"不过我的宝可梦很可爱的哦……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House1/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House1_Text_AnyPokemonCanBeCute"
msgid ""
"Any POKéMON can be cute if you raise\n"
"it with care and kindness.$"
msgstr ""
"只要用心温柔地培养，\n"
"任何宝可梦都会变得很可爱。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House1/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House1_Text_AllSortsOfPlaces"
msgid ""
"In all sorts of places, there are all\n"
"sorts of POKéMON and people.\p"
"I find that fascinating, so I go to all\n"
"sorts of places.$"
msgstr ""
"在各种各样的地方，\n"
"有各种各样的宝可梦和人。\p"
"我觉得那很有意思，\n"
"所以我会去各种各样的地方。$"
